      "evidence_predecessors": [
        "P008-INLINE-MAP-G1-VIRAL-001"
      ],
      "text_source_state": "human_verified",
      "text": "Corrina is a firm believer in auras, crystals, ghosts, and the like. She spent much of her life involved in a weird new age cult in the forests of northern California, though she doesn’t like to talk about it. After leaving the commune, Corrina studied for a degree in Biology, but has since abandoned that and has fallen into a rabbit-hole of occult, folklore, and conspiracy theories. As a result she considers herself a professional Medium. Sadly – at least for her – she’s as spiritually connected as a teapot. Corrina puts on an act of being incredibly sexually free and pretends to be pan-sexual – she is actually very straight.",
      "heading_level": null,
      "source_block_id": "P008-B004",
      "span_ids": [
        "P008-B004-S002"
      ],
      "review_state": "ready_for_review"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "SU-P008-B005-S001",
      "schema_version": "page_review_semantic_units.v1",
      "taxonomy_version": "sourcefold_page_review_taxonomy.v1",
      "unit_type": "paragraph",
      "unit_scope": "in_scope_text",
      "display_style": "body",
      "source_role": "human_verified_span",
      "block_role": "text_column",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "source_region_ids": [
        "PRM-G1-VIRAL-001-P008-R01C-R"
      ],
      "crop_ids": [
        "P008-001-ATT-CROP-CORRINA-RIGHT"
      ],
      "evidence_predecessors": [
        "P008-INLINE-MAP-G1-VIRAL-001"
      ],
      "text_source_state": "human_verified",
      "text": "People tend to judge her on the utter nonsense she comes up with, which she absolutely insists is factual. Unfortunately her confidence and quite fantastic acting ability (she can cry on command – one of Spektral Krew’s fans’ catchphrases is, “Cry Corrina, cry!”, but she hates this so much, the t-shirt for it had to be discontinued from the range of Spektral Krew merchandise) are usually enough to convince the average mark that she’s the real deal. Before an investigation Corrina makes sure to bone-up on the history of a place, but pretends she knows nothing. She also makes up stuff on the spot because she fears that if Marco thinks she’s a fraud, he would fire her (which is true). She occasionally doubts herself, but she has come too far to turn back and intends to see it through to the bitter end. Corrina often claims she is allergic to something in order to avoid suggestions from Spektral Krew’s live audience, especially ones that would potentially expose her as a fraud.",
      "heading_level": null,
      "source_block_id": "P008-B005",
      "span_ids": [
        "P008-B005-S001"
      ],
      "review_state": "ready_for_review"
